        {
          "title": "Expand and cancel the perturbation terms",
          "text": "Expand the two squared norms and C cross term. Since Inv Gr=r, the increment is ⟨u,Gr⟩+⟨v,Ar⟩+(||Gr||²−||Ar||²)/2+⟨A Inv u,Ar⟩−⟨Ar,v⟩+||Ar||². Real symmetry cancels the v terms, the energy identity reduces the quadratic terms to ||r||²/2, and the mixed identity gives ⟨u,Inv r⟩. The result retains the exact positive half.",
